{
  "id": "QaHomeyListeStor",
  "name": "QA Homey - 4. Lister les stories",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "11be4019-c576-48b7-90a5-2f5921019b72",
      "name": "Note liste",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## QA Homey — 4. Lister les stories\nAppelé par la Tour de contrôle (http://localhost:5680) pour afficher les stories à tester : celles du **sprint actif** (`?portee=sprint`) ou de **tout le backlog** (`?portee=backlog`), et les colonnes du tableau Jira (pour vérifier qu'elles correspondent à celles de la Tour). Il ne fait que lire Jira, avec l'identifiant Jira de n8n.\n\nÀ publier une fois (bouton **Publish**), comme les autres flux. Vérifier que la boîte « Jira : chercher les stories » utilise bien l'identifiant **Jira SW Cloud API**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "67ab6d7c-e975-473c-8f40-de2a843371d4",
      "name": "Liste demandée par la Tour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "68983f98-f0cb-4b43-ae00-9332b3ba0e22",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "qa-homey-lister-les-stories",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5f24a070-362d-4d66-88ec-e097a103f0ea",
      "name": "Réglages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d474f06f-ce12-4c82-b1bc-f3bc97c6f7d7",
              "name": "jiraSite",
              "value": "https://testacademy.atlassian.net",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ecb78f6f-3576-41e1-a3ff-e80fd2c17e14",
              "name": "projetJira",
              "value": "HVC",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d63c6b17-5cfa-4da3-82d9-51c48a5b9b51",
              "name": "portee",
              "value": "={{ $('Liste demandée par la Tour').first().json.query.portee === 'sprint' ? 'sprint' : 'backlog' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "50e6a8bd-0722-40e0-9bf6-2e665d250a2f",
      "name": "Jira : chercher les stories",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Réglages').first().json.jiraSite }}/rest/api/3/search/jql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "jiraSoftwareCloudApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "jql",
              "value": "=project = {{ $json.projetJira }} AND issuetype = Story{{ $json.portee === 'sprint' ? ' AND sprint in openSprints()' : '' }} ORDER BY key ASC"
            },
            {
              "name": "fields",
              "value": "summary,status,labels"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxResults",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d926c57f-c22a-4265-9cb1-d455b33e076f",
      "name": "Jira : trouver le tableau",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Réglages').first().json.jiraSite }}/rest/agile/1.0/board",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "jiraSoftwareCloudApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectKeyOrId",
              "value": "={{ $('Réglages').first().json.projetJira }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "397bead9-6b04-437f-a3b2-46da80abbdaf",
      "name": "Jira : colonnes du tableau",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Réglages').first().json.jiraSite }}/rest/agile/1.0/board/{{ $json.values?.[0]?.id ?? 0 }}/configuration",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "jiraSoftwareCloudApi",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8bf0b2ba-6736-46d5-ac8d-9d0a4313febc",
      "name": "Mettre en forme",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Une ligne par story : cle, titre, statut Jira, etiquettes qa-*. Plus les colonnes du\n// tableau Jira, dans l'ordre, pour que la Tour verifie qu'elles correspondent aux siennes.\nconst issues = $('Jira : chercher les stories').first().json.issues || [];\nconst colonnes = ($input.first().json.columnConfig?.columns || []).map(c => c.name);\nconst stories = issues.map(i => ({\n  cle: i.key,\n  titre: i.fields?.summary || '',\n  statut: i.fields?.status?.name || '',\n  etiquettes: (i.fields?.labels || []).filter(l => l.startsWith('qa-')),\n})).sort((a, b) => Number(a.cle.split('-').pop()) - Number(b.cle.split('-').pop()));\nreturn [{ json: { portee: $('Réglages').first().json.portee, stories, colonnes, tableau: $('Jira : trouver le tableau').first().json.values?.[0]?.name || null } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b86bc221-2ed8-48df-ac1f-e5b89cadbd28",
      "name": "Répondre à la Tour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ac3a1263-55a1-4a31-9cca-d3077addb85b",
      "name": "Répondre : Jira en erreur",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ erreur: 'Jira a refusé la recherche : ' + ($json.error?.message || $json.message || 'cause inconnue') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 502
        }
      }
    }
  ],
